@startuml sequence-kitchen-webhook
title Статус кухни — webhook POS → шина → заказ
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "POS / KDS" as POS
participant "POS GW" as GW
queue "Kafka" as KF
participant "Orders" as ORD
participant "Delivery" as DEL
participant "Notify" as NTF
database "PostgreSQL" as PG

POS -> GW: HTTPS webhook\nkitchen.status
GW -> GW: проверка подписи,\nидемпотентность
GW -> KF: KitchenStatusChanged
KF -> ORD: KitchenStatusChanged
ORD -> PG: SQL UPDATE\ncooking / ready
KF -> DEL: KitchenReady\n(старт матчинга, если ещё не начат)
KF -> NTF: PUSH клиенту\n«заказ готов»

@enduml
